      {
        "@value": "Example Implementations Source Code: https://github.com/FilteredPush/event_date_qc/blob/v3.0.5/src/main/java/org/filteredpush/qc/date/DwCEventDQ.java#L334. For a minimum set of unit tests see: [DwcEventDQTest](https://github.com/FilteredPush/event_date_qc/blob/v3.0.5/src/test/java/org/filteredpush/qc/date/DwcEventDQTest.java#L605), see also unit tests for underlying implementation in [DateUtilsTest](https://github.com/FilteredPush/event_date_qc/blob/v3.0.5/src/test/java/org/filteredpush/qc/date/DateUtilsTest.java#L632) and [DateUtilsTest](https://github.com/FilteredPush/event_date_qc/blob/v3.0.5/src/test/java/org/filteredpush/qc/date/DateUtilsTest.java#L788)"
      },
